1
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:11,200
This is how I'll become.

2
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:15,880
This is how I'll become.

3
00:00:18,380 --> 00:00:19,840
Supreme Commander!

4
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:21,260
A hero!

5
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:23,417
This is my story!

6
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:25,640
Let's go.

7
00:00:58,520 --> 00:01:02,197
I've always seen my dreams.

8
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:07,740
It's not so high that I can't.

9
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:13,277
It's not so much that I wanted to be.

10
00:01:13,360 --> 00:01:16,837
That's when you were me.

11
00:01:16,920 --> 00:01:18,357
I was always connected.

12
00:01:18,440 --> 00:01:24,017
I don't want to go in front of
you, I want to go in front of you.

13
00:01:24,100 --> 00:01:27,900
I'll go in front of you.

14
00:01:28,440 --> 00:01:30,897
I'll go in front of this world.

15
00:01:30,980 --> 00:01:33,837
I'll go in front of you.

16
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:37,680
I'll connect with you.

17
00:02:01,940 --> 00:02:03,617
To be

18
00:02:03,700 --> 00:02:10,700
continued...

19
00:02:18,460 --> 00:02:21,677
I heard a rumor that the 7th
Squadron's second-in-command

20
00:02:21,760 --> 00:02:25,231
fainted when she was attacked
by one of the humanoid Shuki.

21
00:02:25,920 --> 00:02:26,880
How pathetic!

22
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:32,617
You're determined to drag the Azuma family's
reputation through the mud, aren't you?

23
00:02:32,700 --> 00:02:34,641
Give it up and come home already.

24
00:02:37,540 --> 00:02:40,660
But to be fair, those
Shuki aren't exactly weak.

25
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:43,548
The 3rd Squadron had a
run-in with them too.

26
00:02:44,180 --> 00:02:45,817
Not just once, but two times.

27
00:02:45,900 --> 00:02:47,200
Strength in numbers.

28
00:02:47,480 --> 00:02:49,417
Us working together would be smart.

29
00:02:49,500 --> 00:02:53,029
We find your presence at battle
reassuring, Commander Kyoka.

30
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:57,577
But some of us are a little hesitant
to put our trust in your entire team.

31
00:02:57,660 --> 00:02:59,260
I won't name any names.

32
00:02:59,480 --> 00:03:02,892
But we're concerned that her
impotence might slow us down.

33
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:11,485
We need to assess the current
capabilities of each of our teams.

34
00:03:12,640 --> 00:03:16,080
How about we hold an inter-squad
Mato exhibition match?

35
00:03:17,620 --> 00:03:18,980
Oh? Huh?

36
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:21,900
A Mato exhibition match?

37
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:23,962
What is this, a baseball league?

38
00:03:26,040 --> 00:03:29,217
An exhibition match is
what we call a contest

39
00:03:29,300 --> 00:03:31,888
of strength and skill
between two squadrons.

40
00:03:32,040 --> 00:03:33,040
That makes sense.

41
00:03:33,460 --> 00:03:35,578
Does single combat sound acceptable?

42
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:39,151
You have never been the type
to mince words, have you, Kyo?

43
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:44,217
Fine by me we'll adjust
our numbers accordingly.

44
00:03:44,300 --> 00:03:47,020
See you later, little slave!

45
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:53,537
Commander, I have a request.

46
00:03:53,620 --> 00:03:56,300
Will you help me prepare
for the exhibition?

47
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,190
Huh?

48
00:03:59,273 --> 00:04:00,737
It's going to be physically demanding.

49
00:04:00,820 --> 00:04:03,037
I'll do whatever it
takes to win the match!

50
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:06,414
Then you'd better buckle down
and start training, right?

51
00:04:09,880 --> 00:04:10,710
Uh?

52
00:04:10,793 --> 00:04:11,623
You heard the commander!

53
00:04:11,706 --> 00:04:15,560
I himity azuma claim you as
my slave from here on out!

54
00:04:22,700 --> 00:04:24,457
Yuki's ramen broth is delicious.

55
00:04:24,540 --> 00:04:26,617
I know it's so good!

56
00:04:26,700 --> 00:04:28,917
I always end up eating
too much of his cooking.

57
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:31,397
Did you use some sort
of secret ingredient?

58
00:04:31,480 --> 00:04:34,117
I wanted it to be rich
and thick this time, so...

59
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:35,417
I tried adding chicken fat.

60
00:04:35,500 --> 00:04:39,317
Your skills are perfect for a slave if
you're good at cleaning and cooking.

61
00:04:39,400 --> 00:04:43,871
Would you please remind me again how I
got roped into being your slave, too?

62
00:04:43,960 --> 00:04:46,517
It's for the sake of the
motto exhibition match.

63
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:48,880
It's absolutely imperative that I win.

64
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:51,677
But that doesn't explain why
I'm being forced to be your...

65
00:04:51,760 --> 00:04:54,525
Keeping it simple this
time with single combat.

66
00:04:55,740 --> 00:04:58,637
So your sister's attitude
struck a nerve, didn't it?

67
00:04:58,720 --> 00:05:01,837
Now you can use this match
as an excuse to kick her ass.

68
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:04,117
Thank you for the chance
to do some ass kicking!

69
00:05:04,200 --> 00:05:05,847
Ass-kicking is your new job!

70
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:07,597
Oh, I'll kick it, all right!

71
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:10,000
What's with all the kicking of asses?!

72
00:05:11,140 --> 00:05:13,397
You still haven't answered my question.

73
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:15,480
Why am I your slave now?

74
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:19,617
Transforming parts of my body into
weapons isn't my main ability.

75
00:05:19,700 --> 00:05:22,300
I only use it because
it's compatible. Huh?

76
00:05:22,840 --> 00:05:24,500
This is my real technique.

77
00:05:25,540 --> 00:05:26,370
Miss Kyoka?

78
00:05:27,080 --> 00:05:30,000
It looks like some sort
of trading card game.

79
00:05:32,080 --> 00:05:32,910
Learning.

80
00:05:33,580 --> 00:05:37,168
I can learn other people's
abilities and use them for myself.

81
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:38,536
That's my specialty.

82
00:05:38,920 --> 00:05:40,567
Isn't that ability super OP?

83
00:05:40,780 --> 00:05:44,477
I select someone's talents that I want
to use on my phone and implement it.

84
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:47,780
What that means is, I can
use the commanders now.

85
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:52,637
You do understand what Miss Kyoka's
ability entails, right? Yeah, yeah.

86
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:54,257
I'm aware it's physically demanding.

87
00:05:54,340 --> 00:05:55,640
I got this, okay?

88
00:05:55,940 --> 00:05:58,397
I don't mind taking
over the cleaning or the

89
00:05:58,480 --> 00:06:01,700
laundry if it means I get
to kick Yachiho's ass.

90
00:06:07,260 --> 00:06:09,500
We're surrounded by Shuuki! Hurry up!

91
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:11,320
Okay, fine, but I warned you!

92
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:36,169
You're in a different shape
than when the commander does it.

93
00:06:41,660 --> 00:06:45,620
I can move with lightning speed
faster than with Miss Kyoka.

94
00:06:47,400 --> 00:06:50,080
But the drawback is
that I'm not as strong.

95
00:06:50,700 --> 00:06:52,180
Well, in that case...

96
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:58,520
I'll just beat on them till they drop!

97
00:06:59,740 --> 00:07:01,975
This is the key to fighting my sister!

98
00:07:07,500 --> 00:07:12,460
You could pick from any number of abilities
tell me why you insist on this one?

99
00:07:13,580 --> 00:07:15,797
It gives you a chance
to be useful even though

100
00:07:15,880 --> 00:07:18,645
you're a man if anything
you ought to be great!

101
00:07:23,640 --> 00:07:25,600
This is the price of her ability.

102
00:07:26,980 --> 00:07:27,810
Huh?

103
00:07:27,893 --> 00:07:31,097
So, by physically demanding,
she really meant...

104
00:07:31,180 --> 00:07:34,004
Wait, how come I can't
control my body movement?

105
00:07:34,160 --> 00:07:36,748
Well, it's because my
reward isn't over yet.

106
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:40,160
But, why does your reward have to be this?

107
00:07:40,980 --> 00:07:43,897
Speaking of which, quit cocking
at me already, you perv.

108
00:07:43,980 --> 00:07:46,377
I would, but if I do that, you might...

109
00:07:46,460 --> 00:07:48,872
On second thought, just see for yourself.

110
00:07:56,760 --> 00:07:58,020
I thought so.

111
00:07:58,180 --> 00:08:03,360
Look, it's the price of her ability,
so it won't stop until I get my reward.

112
00:08:11,440 --> 00:08:14,160
Is this a sufficient
enough reward for you?

113
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:19,760
How indecent!

114
00:08:26,980 --> 00:08:29,777
You would be better off
using a different ability.

115
00:08:29,860 --> 00:08:31,684
Look, I would if I could, okay?

116
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:32,670
Believe me.

117
00:08:32,753 --> 00:08:33,583
So shameful.

118
00:08:34,020 --> 00:08:35,560
Wait, but why can't you?

119
00:08:36,740 --> 00:08:39,137
There's a compatibility
component to learning.

120
00:08:39,220 --> 00:08:42,857
It degrades the quality of most abilities
to the point they become useless.

121
00:08:42,940 --> 00:08:44,520
For example,

122
00:08:44,880 --> 00:08:46,897
if I were to use Shushu's Paradigm Shift,

123
00:08:46,980 --> 00:08:50,921
all it would do is increase my bus
size by about three centimeters.

124
00:08:51,260 --> 00:08:53,757
Okay, but the price of
Miss Kyoka's ability is...

125
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:55,252
I'm aware of that, okay?

126
00:08:57,880 --> 00:09:00,180
Why are you so desperate to win this?

127
00:09:02,340 --> 00:09:04,120
I'm from the Azuma household,

128
00:09:04,380 --> 00:09:07,733
an influential family with
major accomplishments in Mato.

129
00:09:07,920 --> 00:09:11,997
My older sisters are successful, so
everyone had high hopes for me too.

130
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:15,460
But I'd overexert myself before
a big event and get hurt,

131
00:09:15,580 --> 00:09:18,286
or I'd get nervous and
come down with a fever.

132
00:09:18,580 --> 00:09:21,220
I never had any results to show for it.

133
00:09:21,680 --> 00:09:23,440
Yeah, story of my life.

134
00:09:23,740 --> 00:09:25,328
Same with my Peach ability.

135
00:09:25,560 --> 00:09:29,089
I'm guessing they noticed the
problem you mentioned earlier?

136
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:34,377
Because of that, I'd always get teased
whenever I couldn't keep up with my sisters.

137
00:09:34,460 --> 00:09:35,290
I see.

138
00:09:35,560 --> 00:09:38,089
It must have been tough
for you growing up.

139
00:09:38,260 --> 00:09:40,737
This is my first chance
since I cut ties with

140
00:09:40,820 --> 00:09:43,526
the Azuma family to prove
them wrong about me.

141
00:09:43,640 --> 00:09:46,581
So you are going to help
me and be happy about it!

142
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:52,800
It's really hard to want to help someone
when they can't even ask politely.

143
00:09:53,900 --> 00:09:58,780
As for my ultimate goal, I want
to be a hero like the Commander.

144
00:09:59,280 --> 00:10:03,557
I feel like I'll become a better version
of myself if I can beat Yachi-ho.

145
00:10:03,640 --> 00:10:07,993
That part of me that nobody's ever
seen deserves a proper chance to shine.

146
00:10:08,940 --> 00:10:10,680
She's just like me.

147
00:10:10,980 --> 00:10:15,200
Still, we're missing something for
the exhibition match. What's that?

148
00:10:15,680 --> 00:10:18,386
A finishing move that
will demolish our enemy.

149
00:10:18,820 --> 00:10:20,057
Come to think of it,

150
00:10:20,140 --> 00:10:24,258
all I've done so far is mindlessly
punch and kick everything in sight.

151
00:10:24,700 --> 00:10:27,641
I have my own reasons for
wanting to get stronger.

152
00:10:28,920 --> 00:10:32,273
Maybe she's the key to opening
up a new door for me, too.

153
00:10:33,060 --> 00:10:35,589
Even better if I manage
to help Miss Kyoka.

154
00:10:37,140 --> 00:10:38,160
Okay, fine.

155
00:10:38,400 --> 00:10:39,637
I'll do whatever you want.

156
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:40,896
Watch your attitude.

157
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:42,237
You're my slave, remember?

158
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:44,157
You don't have the right to refuse.

159
00:10:44,240 --> 00:10:45,070
Yeah, sure.

160
00:10:45,180 --> 00:10:47,651
Can you tell me what Yachiho's ability is?

161
00:10:48,140 --> 00:10:49,320
It's golden hour.

162
00:10:49,620 --> 00:10:53,208
She can control time, including
freezing it and rewinding it.

163
00:10:54,060 --> 00:10:55,236
Well, we're screwed.

164
00:11:01,380 --> 00:11:05,937
My ears are burning I have a
sneaking suspicion Himari is talking

165
00:11:06,020 --> 00:11:10,737
about me right now Oh Himari
such a worthless little brat it's

166
00:11:10,820 --> 00:11:13,557
only right that she does my bidding
for the Rest of her miserable

167
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:19,260
life I'm going to put her in her
place at the exhibition match

168
00:11:21,020 --> 00:11:23,500
I can't wait for the big day to arrive

169
00:11:30,200 --> 00:11:33,900
Yachi-ho's ability is dangerous
for sure, but it takes power.

170
00:11:34,400 --> 00:11:38,297
She'll get tired if she uses it too
many times, and that's how we'll win.

171
00:11:38,380 --> 00:11:41,677
The fact that she can use it more
than once makes things tricky, though.

172
00:11:41,760 --> 00:11:45,113
Also, she strikes a very odd
pose to trigger her ability.

173
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:47,791
It's a routine that emphasizes her skills.

174
00:11:48,860 --> 00:11:49,690
Hmm.

175
00:11:49,773 --> 00:11:51,077
So then we'll have to
beat her to the punch.

176
00:11:51,160 --> 00:11:55,397
In that case, we ought to take advantage
of my speed for our finishing move.

177
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:56,310
Exactly.

178
00:11:56,393 --> 00:11:59,417
An ultra-fast maneuver that won't
give her a chance to freeze time.

179
00:11:59,500 --> 00:12:01,760
And no leeway to rewind time either.

180
00:12:02,040 --> 00:12:05,357
An attack with enough force to knock
her out of the fight completely.

181
00:12:05,440 --> 00:12:08,960
So, like, a swift step
forward into a head-on punch.

182
00:12:09,220 --> 00:12:11,120
I think that would be fastest.

183
00:12:11,940 --> 00:12:14,940
Let's polish it into a
deadly blow she can't dodge.

184
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:19,847
I want you to try channeling all your
strength into a single part of your body.

185
00:12:21,160 --> 00:12:21,990
Hmm.

186
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:25,030
Channel.

187
00:12:25,700 --> 00:12:28,500
All my strength to my legs!

188
00:12:29,300 --> 00:12:30,130
It worked!

189
00:12:30,213 --> 00:12:31,820
Whoa, you actually did it!

190
00:12:33,400 --> 00:12:36,077
Just in time for our
practice dummies to arrive.

191
00:12:36,160 --> 00:12:36,990
Hell yeah!

192
00:12:39,520 --> 00:12:41,017
I'm even faster than before.

193
00:12:41,100 --> 00:12:43,800
At this rate, we're golden!

194
00:12:46,140 --> 00:12:48,180
Wait, why didn't it work?

195
00:12:54,700 --> 00:12:57,077
My lower half is exhausted.

196
00:12:57,160 --> 00:13:00,237
You probably lost most
of your arm strength

197
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:02,497
because you poured all
your energy into your legs.

198
00:13:02,580 --> 00:13:06,557
Instead, we'll keep experimenting with
it until we perfect your technique.

199
00:13:06,640 --> 00:13:08,700
Uh, is this my reward?

200
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:18,577
Wow, he does look different than
when he's with me, commander?

201
00:13:18,660 --> 00:13:22,320
Miss Kyoka, keep it up! Roger! Smart.

202
00:13:22,580 --> 00:13:26,677
Channeling his strength into a single body
part to produce a more powerful effect.

203
00:13:26,760 --> 00:13:28,289
It's a proactive approach.

204
00:13:28,420 --> 00:13:29,757
You've got a knack for this.

205
00:13:29,840 --> 00:13:31,369
Gee, thank you, Commander.

206
00:13:31,800 --> 00:13:35,388
That being said, why are you
watching him from way back here?

207
00:13:35,580 --> 00:13:36,797
Well, I...

208
00:13:36,880 --> 00:13:41,540
You mustn't forget the fundamental
essence of my ability. Its essence?

209
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:46,000
Make me proud.

210
00:13:47,760 --> 00:13:48,590
Hey!

211
00:13:48,673 --> 00:13:50,757
I'll be riding you during the exhibition.

212
00:13:50,840 --> 00:13:53,057
Let's do this like it's the real deal.

213
00:13:53,140 --> 00:13:57,728
This ability requires dominating a slave,
not just standing back and coaching.

214
00:13:58,020 --> 00:13:59,260
Get on top of him.

215
00:13:59,720 --> 00:14:03,340
Seize the slave's chains and
command him as his master.

216
00:14:03,860 --> 00:14:06,272
Channel all your strength into your legs.

217
00:14:07,600 --> 00:14:08,560
That's strange.

218
00:14:09,140 --> 00:14:11,905
I feel more power flowing
through me this time.

219
00:14:13,540 --> 00:14:15,120
Go crush that Shuki!

220
00:14:28,960 --> 00:14:31,220
Whoa, did I really just do that?

221
00:14:31,440 --> 00:14:33,200
A foolproof finishing move!

222
00:14:34,020 --> 00:14:35,800
I got lost in the moment.

223
00:14:36,080 --> 00:14:39,400
I'm not sure if I can replicate
that. Oh, don't worry.

224
00:14:40,080 --> 00:14:42,609
Mato has plenty of
practice dummies to use.

225
00:14:47,120 --> 00:14:49,657
I'm a million times more
worn out than usual.

226
00:14:49,740 --> 00:14:52,397
Your technique lacks precision sometimes.

227
00:14:52,480 --> 00:14:55,068
We need to practice and
develop consistency.

228
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,997
Your clothes are...

229
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:59,551
Look, it's the price of her ability, okay?

230
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:01,060
I swear.

231
00:15:01,720 --> 00:15:02,550
Indecent.

232
00:15:07,180 --> 00:15:08,580
Bring it on, Shuki!

233
00:15:08,840 --> 00:15:13,369
I'm gonna master this technique so I
can put it into use again in the future!

234
00:15:13,720 --> 00:15:15,180
That's the spirit, Yuki.

235
00:15:28,180 --> 00:15:29,580
Let's go.

236
00:16:19,740 --> 00:16:21,800
I feel good that's great,

237
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:25,657
but once the exhibition is done
the Himariyuki duel will be over.

238
00:16:25,740 --> 00:16:29,337
I guess so after all he
belongs to the commander

239
00:16:29,420 --> 00:16:32,560
not me and it's a physically
demanding ability.

240
00:16:33,860 --> 00:16:38,677
For now let's focus on today the whole
demon defense force will know who won.

241
00:16:38,760 --> 00:16:43,020
And the outcome will affect our
squadrons the commander's reputation.

242
00:16:43,640 --> 00:16:46,720
We've got to put our
best foot forward. Right!

243
00:16:47,040 --> 00:16:50,880
Both for myself and the commander,
since she organized this.

244
00:16:51,320 --> 00:16:52,420
I can't lose!

245
00:16:52,700 --> 00:16:56,897
That reminds me, aren't the other members
of the Six Squadron supposed to show up?

246
00:16:56,980 --> 00:16:57,810
Huh?

247
00:17:01,300 --> 00:17:02,130
Hello!

248
00:17:02,213 --> 00:17:04,820
We got here a little early,
so I came to de-stress.

249
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:07,294
Since when was she in the Six Squadron?

250
00:17:07,660 --> 00:17:09,280
That's Sahara Wakasam.

251
00:17:09,580 --> 00:17:13,462
She's a homebody, so it's rare to
see her out and about like this.

252
00:17:17,680 --> 00:17:19,880
And now she's asleep? How funny!

253
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:22,235
She's certainly got guts, doesn't she?

254
00:17:27,260 --> 00:17:28,560
Go ahead without me.

255
00:17:28,840 --> 00:17:30,157
You'll do great, Himari.

256
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:31,122
Don't sweat it.

257
00:17:31,720 --> 00:17:34,097
Taking a bath before the exhibition match?

258
00:17:34,180 --> 00:17:36,415
You must be feeling awfully confident.

259
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:40,395
I intend to be clean and
well-groomed when I win today.

260
00:17:40,880 --> 00:17:41,710
Oh, yeah?

261
00:17:41,793 --> 00:17:43,897
It sounds like you've got a plan in mind.

262
00:17:43,980 --> 00:17:47,360
But the question is, can
you actually pull it off?

263
00:17:55,840 --> 00:17:56,670
Of course!

264
00:17:56,900 --> 00:17:57,800
I know I can!

265
00:17:58,880 --> 00:18:00,998
Oh, you still haven't left the dorm?

266
00:18:01,360 --> 00:18:03,478
The match is supposed to start soon.

267
00:18:03,580 --> 00:18:05,698
You're only delaying the inevitable.

268
00:18:09,820 --> 00:18:10,857
It'll be okay.

269
