You're holding on.

334
00:22:52,840 --> 00:22:53,840
You're being sad.

335
00:22:55,840 --> 00:22:57,117
You're holding on.

336
00:23:01,000 --> 00:23:02,357
I won't be able to leave it.

337
00:23:02,440 --> 00:23:05,320
I won't be able to leave it.

338
00:23:27,200 --> 00:23:29,897
pay or she can't switch out
for a different skill later.

339
00:23:29,980 --> 00:23:32,577
Every technique used
requires lots of studying.

340
00:23:32,660 --> 00:23:35,397
It's the perfect skill for
someone like Miss Himari.
